    "intro": {
      "zh": "Sega Saturn 是世嘉 1994 年发布的 32 位家用游戏机，以双 SH-2 CPU 的复杂架构与 CD-ROM 介质，与同期的 PlayStation、Nintendo 64 展开第五代主机之争。它在日本市场一度热销，却因架构复杂、欧美市场失守，成为世嘉由盛转衰的转折点，是游戏机厅第五代主机叙事的重要锚点。",
      "en": "The Sega Saturn, released by Sega in 1994, was a 32-bit home console with a complex dual SH-2 CPU architecture and CD-ROM media, competing against the PlayStation and Nintendo 64 in the fifth console generation. It sold well in Japan but lost ground in the West, marking the turning point of Sega's decline."
    },
    "era": 1994,
    "manufacturer": "Sega"
  },
